flowchart LR
  X["Block N of a file fails"] --> REC["record becomes Failed<br/>progress saved"]
  REC --> A{"MigrationErrorAction"}
  A -->|Terminate| E["run result Error (90)"]
  A -->|Rollback<br/>RollbackErrorOnly<br/>RollbackRelease| RB["run the rollback files<br/>of this run"]
  RB -->|all succeed| RV["run result Recovered (80)"]
  RB -->|a rollback fails| E
  A -->|Ignore| IG["mark the file Failed,<br/>continue with the next"] --> PS["run result PartialSuccess (50)"]
  E --> C1["exit code 1"]
  RV --> C1
  PS --> C1
